      "id": "8f16e380-4a00-40e9-890b-7b2766abe2c7",
      "name": "Get today tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1600,
        200
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build prompt — gives the agent its role, rules, today's state and the output format\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst userText = $('Read messages').first().json.text;\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.id);\n\nconst taskList = rows.length\n  ? rows.map(r => `#${r.id} | ${r.title} | priority=${r.priority} | est=${r.estimate_min}min | status=${r.status}`).join('\\n')\n  : '(no tasks saved for today yet)';\n\nconst system = `You are \"Daily Planner\", a personal planning agent inside a Telegram bot.\nYou help ONE person plan their day, track tasks and see honest daily KPIs.\nAlways write the \"reply\" field in natural, friendly Persian (Farsi). Keep it short.\n\nTODAY: ${cfg.today}\nDAILY CAPACITY: ${cfg.daily_capacity_min} minutes of focused work\nTODAY'S TASKS (id | title | priority | estimate | status):\n${taskList}\n\nDecide exactly ONE action for the user's message:\n- \"add_tasks\": the user lists things they want/need to do. Extract each task.\n  priority: \"high\" (deadline today, important for others, or user says urgent), \"medium\", or \"low\".\n  estimate_min: realistic minutes. If the user gives a time, use it. Otherwise estimate (15-120).\n  In \"reply\": confirm the tasks, suggest an order (high first), and if total planned minutes\n  (existing + new) exceed DAILY CAPACITY, say so honestly and suggest what to move to tomorrow.\n- \"mark_done\": the user says something is finished. Put the matching ids in \"done_ids\".\n  ONLY use ids from TODAY'S TASKS. If nothing matches clearly, use \"chat\" and ask which one.\n- \"report\": the user asks for a report, KPI, summary, or how the day went.\n- \"chat\": anything else (questions, greetings, unclear). Answer briefly in \"reply\".\n\nRules:\n- Never invent tasks the user did not mention. Never mark tasks done the user did not mention.\n- Output ONLY one JSON object. No markdown, no code fences, no text before or after it.\n\nOutput format:\n{\"action\":\"add_tasks|mark_done|report|chat\",\"tasks\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"priority\":\"high|medium|low\",\"estimate_min\":30}],\"done_ids\":[1],\"reply\":\"...\"}\n\nExamples:\nUser: \"امروز باید گزارش فروش رو تا ظهر بفرستم، یه ساعت هم ورزش\"\n{\"action\":\"add_tasks\",\"tasks\":[{\"title\":\"ارسال گزارش فروش\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"estimate_min\":90},{\"title\":\"ورزش\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"estimate_min\":60}],\"done_ids\":[],\"reply\":\"ثبت شد. اول گزارش فروش (مهلتش ظهره)، بعد ورزش.\"}\nUser: \"گزارش رو فرستادم\"  (and task #3 is \"ارسال گزارش فروش\")\n{\"action\":\"mark_done\",\"tasks\":[],\"done_ids\":[3],\"reply\":\"عالی، گزارش فروش تیک خورد.\"}`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { body: {\n  model: cfg.model,\n  temperature: 0.2,\n  messages: [\n    { role: 'system', content: system },\n    { role: 'user', content: userText }\n  ]\n} } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "fcd7ed52-1927-4c99-b967-1af05d953168",
      "name": "Build prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1820,
